WEBVTT

00:00:02.330 --> 00:00:05.370
Seizing on the incident that
happened on Valentine's Day,

00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:07.870
it was merely something that
had slipped out without thought,

00:00:07.870 --> 00:00:11.240
so I never even considered
that she might say okay to it.

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:12.330
A date?

00:00:13.070 --> 00:00:15.810
Oh, no, um, that is...

00:00:15.810 --> 00:00:16.950
That sounds like fun.

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:17.500
What?

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:18.500
When?

00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:19.950
Um...

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:22.240
Then, how about next Sunday?

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:24.920
All right. Where shall we go?

00:00:25.090 --> 00:00:27.420
Do you have any preferences, Onee-sama?

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:29.850
I would like to go where you want to go.

00:00:30.290 --> 00:00:32.090
Then, I will think about it.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.600
The maidens, who flock to
Maria-sama's garden,

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:44.130
pass through the tall gates today yet
again with innocent, angelic smiles.

00:00:44.970 --> 00:00:49.140
Their pure hearts and bodies are
clad in deep-colored uniforms.

00:00:49.640 --> 00:00:52.110
So that the pleats of their
skirts are not disturbed...

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:55.450
...and so that their white sailor
collars are not set aflutter,

00:00:55.650 --> 00:00:58.740
it is customary here to walk
slowly and with decorum.

00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:04.220
The Private Lillian Girls' Academy,
a garden of maidens.

00:01:13.540 --> 00:01:18.170
Maria Watches Over Us

00:02:36.480 --> 00:02:40.920
The First Date Triangle

00:02:44.530 --> 00:02:46.890
She said the places I want
to go to are fine and good,

00:02:47.230 --> 00:02:50.160
but there's no point if my
Onee-sama doesn't enjoy herself.

00:02:51.870 --> 00:02:54.860
I think I'll ask about her preferences
again tomorrow, after all.

00:03:02.540 --> 00:03:04.340
Good morning, Onee-sama.

00:03:05.050 --> 00:03:06.450
Good morning, Yumi.

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:09.240
Have you decided on a schedule for our date?

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:12.640
Uh, um, well... About that...

00:03:12.820 --> 00:03:14.790
Where shall we meet up?

00:03:14.960 --> 00:03:17.980
To start with, 11 o'clock in the
morning at the train station gates.

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:21.290
W-What am I doing,
saying whatever comes to mind?!

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:22.430
Understood.

00:03:22.900 --> 00:03:25.490
Just where will you be taking me?

00:03:25.770 --> 00:03:28.760
Let us leave that a surprise until the date.

00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:31.040
Then, I shall be looking forward to it.

00:03:31.410 --> 00:03:33.640
Y-Yes, please leave it to me.

00:03:35.140 --> 00:03:38.700
Since it's come to this, I'll just
have to ask Yoshino-san for advice.

00:03:39.310 --> 00:03:42.720
Yoshino-san must have gone
on many dates with Rei-sama,

00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:44.410
so she may give me some good ideas...

00:03:56.200 --> 00:03:58.130
Yoshino-san, what are you doing?

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:03.530
I'm making a list of the chocolates
that Rei-chan didn't decline.

00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:05.940
Because she can't miss anyone
when she gives return gifts.

00:04:05.940 --> 00:04:07.810
That's so admirable of you, Yoshino-san.

00:04:08.340 --> 00:04:11.640
Honestly, it's such trouble to
have a popular big sister.

00:04:11.910 --> 00:04:13.310
Oh, you needn't brag!

00:04:14.480 --> 00:04:16.140
I envy you, Yumi-san.

00:04:16.750 --> 00:04:20.740
Sachiko-sama didn't accept any
chocolates except yours, right?

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:24.160
Pardon my big sister for being so conscientious.

00:04:24.560 --> 00:04:26.120
My, you needn't brag!

00:04:30.330 --> 00:04:33.530
Say, Yoshino-san, could
I ask you a little question?

00:04:33.770 --> 00:04:34.460
What is it?

00:04:34.970 --> 00:04:37.540
Well, it's about going on a date...

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:40.870
A date, huh? Don't remind me.

00:04:41.410 --> 00:04:42.600
Oh, right.

00:04:42.780 --> 00:04:46.410
Rei-sama is set to go on a date with
Miss Chisato Tanuma, isn't she?

00:04:47.250 --> 00:04:48.880
I'm sorry, Yoshino-san.

00:04:49.280 --> 00:04:53.380
It's fine. It's just an event. It doesn't bother me.

00:04:53.860 --> 00:04:55.690
She's bothered by it a whole lot, though...

00:04:56.490 --> 00:04:57.820
But this is a problem.

00:04:58.090 --> 00:05:02.830
If I can't ask Yoshino-san,
I'd want to ask Shimako-san for advice,

00:05:02.830 --> 00:05:05.260
but I imagine she has her
own problems to deal with...

00:05:06.870 --> 00:05:09.740
After all, she has to go on
a date with Shizuka-sama,

00:05:09.740 --> 00:05:14.370
who's her rival when it
comes to Rosa Gigantea.

00:05:22.180 --> 00:05:23.710
In our case,

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:26.720
it may actually be Shizuka-sama
who is going to have a rough time.

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:30.930
Because she must write a
report regarding our date...

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:33.620
...and submit it to the school paper.

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:34.690
What?!

00:05:35.300 --> 00:05:37.600
In exchange for being obligated to do that,

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:41.030
it seems the school paper will be
covering the cost of our date.

00:05:41.170 --> 00:05:43.360
Uh... Cost of the date?

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:44.930
Is something the matter?

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:47.560
I completely forgot about the costs!

00:05:48.180 --> 00:05:50.410
Incidentally, about how
much is being budgeted?

00:05:50.550 --> 00:05:52.240
I hear it's 3000 yen per couple.

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:54.310
3000 yen, huh?

00:05:54.980 --> 00:05:57.450
I'm the one who asked my Onee-sama out,

00:05:57.890 --> 00:05:59.520
so it's only natural that
I should bear the costs, right?

00:05:59.520 --> 00:05:59.920
Oh...

00:06:04.890 --> 00:06:06.550
Oh, Shizuka-sama...

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:11.700
Are you not looking forward to going
on a date with Shizuka-sama, after all?

00:06:12.830 --> 00:06:16.000
I don't dislike Shizuka-sama, but... yes, a little.

00:06:18.570 --> 00:06:21.410
Shimako-san can't be in the
mood to give me advice...

00:06:21.410 --> 00:06:23.340
...on where to go on a date, either.

00:06:27.180 --> 00:06:28.440
Hello there, Yumi-san.

00:06:29.080 --> 00:06:30.020
Tsutako-san.

00:06:30.390 --> 00:06:32.620
What were you talking about
with Shimako-san earlier?

00:06:33.190 --> 00:06:35.950
Did she say where she was going
on her date with Shizuka-sama?

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:39.890
Don't tell me you intend to secretly
photograph them on their date?

00:06:40.060 --> 00:06:43.330
But I've been asked to by
Minako-sama of the school paper.

00:06:43.830 --> 00:06:45.230
Because it feels more real...

00:06:45.230 --> 00:06:48.600
...if they print photographic
evidence along with the reports.

00:06:49.140 --> 00:06:51.730
Does this have everyone's approval?

00:06:52.140 --> 00:06:52.940
Hardly.

00:06:53.240 --> 00:06:56.900
We haven't even been notified where
they'll be going on their dates.

00:06:57.580 --> 00:07:00.450
That's why I'm working desperately
here to gather information.

00:07:00.820 --> 00:07:01.940
But...

00:07:02.380 --> 00:07:05.090
Oh, naturally, in the event that
the photographs are printed,

00:07:05.090 --> 00:07:07.080
I'll get consent from the people in question.

00:07:07.760 --> 00:07:11.190
But I'll be less of a bother if they
don't know about it on the day of.

00:07:14.130 --> 00:07:16.760
With an undiminished pile of problems,
too many to count,

00:07:16.760 --> 00:07:18.700
the day of the date finally came...

00:07:20.030 --> 00:07:23.200
In the end, I never came up with
a plan for a wonderful date...

00:07:23.200 --> 00:07:24.900
...and today is here already. I can't believe it...

00:07:26.470 --> 00:07:27.940
Oh? You're still here?

00:07:28.110 --> 00:07:29.970
Being late to a date is a no-no, isn't it?

00:07:30.580 --> 00:07:31.910
I know that!

00:07:32.210 --> 00:07:34.110
Let me guess. Are you nervous?

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:36.480
The most I've ever been in my life!

00:07:36.550 --> 00:07:37.750
If I could,

00:07:37.750 --> 00:07:40.810
I'd almost want to curl up into a
quivering ball in a corner of my room.

00:07:41.360 --> 00:07:43.410
You should be more easygoing about this.

00:07:43.860 --> 00:07:46.120
If I could do that,
I wouldn't have these problems.

00:07:46.790 --> 00:07:48.760
After all, it's my first date ever,

00:07:48.760 --> 00:07:50.890
not to mention it's a date with my Onee-sama...

00:07:51.500 --> 00:07:53.700
Well, you just be careful,

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:56.140
so she doesn't end up revoking
your relationship as soeurs today.

00:07:56.670 --> 00:07:59.640
Honestly! Don't say such unlucky things!

00:08:00.980 --> 00:08:02.880
I was joking. It's just a joke.

00:08:13.450 --> 00:08:15.220
10:40, huh?

00:08:16.120 --> 00:08:19.060
Onee-sama is not the sort to come late,

00:08:19.830 --> 00:08:21.630
but I suppose she's also not the type...

00:08:21.630 --> 00:08:24.190
...to get all excited like me
and get here too early.

00:08:24.300 --> 00:08:26.230
I'd better regain my composure
while I have the chance.

00:08:26.230 --> 00:08:26.960
Yumi-san?

00:08:27.700 --> 00:08:28.600
Tsutako-san?

00:08:28.870 --> 00:08:30.900
Why are you here, Yumi-san?

00:08:31.140 --> 00:08:32.800
T-That's because...

00:08:33.170 --> 00:08:34.510
Are you meeting someone?

00:08:34.880 --> 00:08:37.210
Don't tell me it's Sachiko-sama?

00:08:37.210 --> 00:08:39.080
A-A friend! A friend!

00:08:39.150 --> 00:08:41.440
Anyway, what about you? Why are you here?

00:08:41.920 --> 00:08:45.550
As a place that can be enjoyed within
the limits of the 3000 yen budget...

00:08:45.550 --> 00:08:47.460
...and as a place that can
be reached with a train pass,

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:49.290
this town is the ideal date spot.

00:08:49.620 --> 00:08:51.150
After giving it a lot of thought,

00:08:51.430 --> 00:08:53.050
I figured everyone would choose to come here.

00:08:53.360 --> 00:08:54.450
Shoot.

00:08:55.230 --> 00:08:58.630
But I wonder if everyone will
gather in this town so easily.

00:08:58.930 --> 00:09:01.600
Well, in the event that I don't
get a photograph of anyone,

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:04.540
I'll just capture the private life...

00:09:04.540 --> 00:09:06.800
...of Rosa Chinensis en bouton petite soeur.

00:09:07.640 --> 00:09:08.610
That's not fair!

00:09:09.040 --> 00:09:10.740
But well, don't worry.

00:09:11.210 --> 00:09:12.880
Above all else, my goal today...

00:09:12.880 --> 00:09:15.850
...is to capture the white
and yellow dates on film.

00:09:17.550 --> 00:09:20.350
Ooh! And I've got a nice photo op already!

00:09:20.420 --> 00:09:21.080
What?!

00:09:22.590 --> 00:09:23.420
Look, there!

00:09:23.490 --> 00:09:25.580
Rosa Foetida en bouton just arrived.

00:09:26.230 --> 00:09:28.700
Which means, Tanuma Chisato is also...

00:09:29.560 --> 00:09:30.090
...here!

00:09:31.200 --> 00:09:31.720
Hey.

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:34.130
Thank you for taking the
trouble to meet me today.

00:09:34.740 --> 00:09:35.720
Well, excuse me now!

00:09:42.440 --> 00:09:44.070
Chisato-san looks cute.

00:09:45.050 --> 00:09:48.610
I wonder if I should've not been shy
about it and dressed up more.

00:09:49.980 --> 00:09:51.820
I wore jeans...

00:09:51.890 --> 00:09:54.580
What'll I do if I don't match
how my Onee-sama is dressed?

00:09:55.660 --> 00:09:56.280
Yumi.

00:09:58.490 --> 00:09:59.520
Onee-sama...

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:05.900
Good morning.

00:10:07.170 --> 00:10:10.430
I really am a horrible match for her...

00:10:12.410 --> 00:10:15.810
Maria Watches Over Us

00:10:22.050 --> 00:10:22.950
Is something the matter?

00:10:23.880 --> 00:10:26.880
N-No, I can't falter now.

00:10:28.020 --> 00:10:29.150
N-Not at all.

00:10:29.790 --> 00:10:30.690
Oh, yes.

00:10:31.160 --> 00:10:32.590
Here, before I forget.

00:10:33.190 --> 00:10:35.820
Oh, I humbly accept.

00:10:36.830 --> 00:10:38.800
Is 1500 yen really enough?

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:41.470
By rights, as the big sister,

00:10:41.470 --> 00:10:43.770
the cost of the date should naturally fall to me.

00:10:44.070 --> 00:10:44.830
It's fine.

00:10:45.240 --> 00:10:47.470
After all, I asked you out this time.

00:10:48.310 --> 00:10:51.470
I'm already feeling bad enough
having you pay for half of it.

00:10:51.710 --> 00:10:54.240
Really, you're so stubborn, Yumi.

00:10:55.150 --> 00:10:55.950
Let us go.

00:10:56.820 --> 00:10:58.190
You are as well, Onee-sama.

00:10:58.190 --> 00:11:00.950
Oh, yes. Do you mind if
we make a little side trip?

00:11:01.490 --> 00:11:02.790
I want to buy a dictionary.

00:11:03.260 --> 00:11:04.750
A dictionary?

00:11:05.230 --> 00:11:09.420
Personal purchases can be made out
of our individual wallets, right?

00:11:09.960 --> 00:11:13.630
Yes, but if you buy it now,
you will have to carry it around.

00:11:14.240 --> 00:11:16.330
Why not buy it on our way home?

00:11:16.970 --> 00:11:19.600
You're right. That would definitely be better.

00:11:19.840 --> 00:11:21.780
You're so smart.

00:11:21.780 --> 00:11:24.750
Is my Onee-sama not used to going shopping?

00:11:25.410 --> 00:11:28.780
Could it be that people from
the purveyors of the estate...

00:11:28.780 --> 00:11:30.270
...normally deliver all purchases?

00:11:30.520 --> 00:11:33.050
Or maybe when she goes out shopping,

00:11:33.050 --> 00:11:35.610
her attendant carries her things for her.

00:11:36.560 --> 00:11:39.750
Was it really a good idea to ask
her out on a date like this?

00:11:40.630 --> 00:11:41.960
Is something the matter, Yumi?

00:11:42.230 --> 00:11:43.160
N-No.

00:11:43.630 --> 00:11:44.930
Then, shall we go?

00:11:44.930 --> 00:11:45.520
Yes.

00:11:48.540 --> 00:11:50.830
Why are Yumi-san and Sachiko-sama here?!

00:11:51.110 --> 00:11:55.470
Or rather, it's more of a
mystery why I'm here, isn't it?

00:11:55.810 --> 00:11:59.300
To think I had the nerve to come,
because I'm anxious about Rei-chan's date.

00:12:00.250 --> 00:12:01.840
Yoshino-san, right?

00:12:02.180 --> 00:12:03.380
Minako-sama!

00:12:04.520 --> 00:12:08.180
Uh, this was my idea of a disguise, but...

00:12:08.390 --> 00:12:09.190
You could tell?

00:12:09.560 --> 00:12:12.550
I could totally tell, or rather,
you stand out more this way.

00:12:14.760 --> 00:12:15.960
Nevermind that.

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:19.400
You came to keep an eye on them
because you're worried, right?

00:12:19.770 --> 00:12:22.900
Not at all, since I'm not interested.

00:12:23.370 --> 00:12:25.300
Oh, you don't have to be shy.

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:29.400
After all, your most beloved Onee-sama
is on a date with another girl!

00:12:29.540 --> 00:12:31.440
It's only natural that you would be jealous.

00:12:32.510 --> 00:12:33.840
You have it all wrong.

00:12:33.980 --> 00:12:37.470
I have an engagement with Yumi-san
and her companion today.

00:12:37.720 --> 00:12:39.320
Yumi-san and her companion?

00:12:39.320 --> 00:12:41.350
You don't mean Yumi-san and Sachiko-san?!

00:12:41.790 --> 00:12:43.850
What? Yes, well...

00:12:44.020 --> 00:12:46.490
That's a combination that strokes my interest.

00:12:47.260 --> 00:12:48.590
I'm sorry, Yumi-san!

00:12:49.060 --> 00:12:50.660
Incidentally, Minako-sama,

00:12:51.070 --> 00:12:55.130
if you don't get going soon, don't you
run the risk of not finding everyone?

00:12:55.570 --> 00:13:00.310
After all, unlike cards, today's
treasure will be moving around,

00:13:00.310 --> 00:13:01.970
so it must be tough!

00:13:11.250 --> 00:13:16.250
Um, Onee-sama, is there really
nowhere that you wish to go?

00:13:16.490 --> 00:13:17.320
There isn't.

00:13:17.860 --> 00:13:21.450
I want to be taken where you want to go.

00:13:22.100 --> 00:13:22.760
I see...

00:13:23.600 --> 00:13:26.790
I want to try doing the
things that you normally do.

00:13:27.130 --> 00:13:30.400
Then, perhaps some window
shopping to start with?

00:13:30.810 --> 00:13:31.790
That sounds splendid.

00:13:34.180 --> 00:13:35.510
We're going in here?

00:13:35.810 --> 00:13:38.680
Yes, there are a lot of little shops in here,

00:13:38.750 --> 00:13:40.870
so just looking around can be fun.

00:13:40.950 --> 00:13:41.540
I see.

00:13:42.150 --> 00:13:43.450
Would you be all right with this?

00:13:43.750 --> 00:13:45.810
You needn't check with
me each and every time.

00:13:45.990 --> 00:13:47.110
Come on, let's go.

00:13:47.450 --> 00:13:48.920
Oh, O-Onee-sama!

00:13:57.230 --> 00:13:58.160
Onee-sama?

00:13:59.370 --> 00:14:01.540
Why don't we start by taking
the elevator to the top floor...

00:14:01.540 --> 00:14:03.470
...and come down in stages?

00:14:04.000 --> 00:14:07.460
It was written in a feng shui
book that doing so was better...

00:14:09.010 --> 00:14:11.310
You're particular about some
strange things, aren't you?

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:13.950
Because even the slightest good thing...

00:14:13.950 --> 00:14:16.350
...that might happen while I'm with
her would make me happy.

00:14:16.850 --> 00:14:19.720
Then, shall we follow the
teachings of feng shui?

00:14:21.520 --> 00:14:22.250
Thank goodness.

00:14:23.160 --> 00:14:24.280
New Lord of Monster:
A Certain Love

00:14:27.330 --> 00:14:29.830
Rei-sama, was this movie all right?

00:14:29.830 --> 00:14:31.730
Of course. Now, shall we go?

00:14:35.200 --> 00:14:36.430
So close!

00:14:36.800 --> 00:14:39.030
I was just a little late in taking the shot!

00:14:39.170 --> 00:14:39.510
New Lord of Monster:
A Certain Love

00:14:39.510 --> 00:14:42.880
New Lord of Monster:
A Certain Love
But to go see a movie on a 3000 yen budget?

00:14:42.880 --> 00:14:44.550
New Lord of Monster:
A Certain Love
That might not leave enough for lunch.

00:14:44.550 --> 00:14:44.770
New Lord of Monster:
A Certain Love

00:14:45.150 --> 00:14:45.980
Oh, well.

00:14:46.450 --> 00:14:49.180
I'll take this opportunity to
get myself something to eat.

00:14:55.860 --> 00:14:56.690
Shimako-san?!

00:14:58.630 --> 00:15:00.890
Should I give up paying
for this and follow her?

00:15:01.130 --> 00:15:03.930
But I won't be able to get a photo in this crowd.

00:15:04.630 --> 00:15:05.160
Oh!

00:15:06.830 --> 00:15:07.860
Shizuka-sama?!

00:15:08.400 --> 00:15:10.170
What's going on with those two?

00:15:10.570 --> 00:15:12.800
They're on a date, but they're
each doing their own thing?

00:15:13.140 --> 00:15:14.070
By the look on your face,

00:15:14.070 --> 00:15:15.940
it seems you have yet to get your money shot.

00:15:16.280 --> 00:15:17.440
Minako-sama?

00:15:22.850 --> 00:15:24.750
It's just like Yoshino-san said.

00:15:24.750 --> 00:15:25.150
What?

00:15:25.550 --> 00:15:28.350
I happened to run into her
earlier and she said to me,

00:15:28.890 --> 00:15:33.350
"Unlike cards, today's treasure will be
moving around, so it must be tough."

00:15:33.860 --> 00:15:35.690
Please rest easy, Minako-sama.

00:15:36.030 --> 00:15:38.430
I have found myself a trump card.

00:15:38.670 --> 00:15:39.600
A trump card?

00:15:39.930 --> 00:15:40.730
Right now,

00:15:40.730 --> 00:15:44.600
Rei-sama and Tanuma Chisato-san
are in the midst of viewing a movie.

00:15:46.040 --> 00:15:47.560
Which means...

00:15:48.010 --> 00:15:51.180
Once we finish lunch, we'll
immediately go back to the theater...

00:15:51.180 --> 00:15:52.650
...and lie in wait for them.

00:15:53.250 --> 00:15:56.550
In dealing with a mobile opponent,
my strategy is to remain stationary!

00:15:57.690 --> 00:15:59.480
I'm impressed, Tsutako-san.

00:16:05.030 --> 00:16:07.520
What did you think of window shopping?

00:16:07.700 --> 00:16:08.920
I enjoyed it.

00:16:09.700 --> 00:16:10.690
I'm so glad.

00:16:11.030 --> 00:16:11.760
But...

00:16:12.570 --> 00:16:13.260
But?

00:16:13.900 --> 00:16:17.270
Dealing with all the clerks who come
to recommend their various wares...

00:16:17.270 --> 00:16:18.200
...can be exhausting.

00:16:20.980 --> 00:16:22.840
Musashino 73 Lillian Girls' Academy Loop

00:16:26.180 --> 00:16:29.050
Shizuka-sama, what are you thinking?

00:16:30.920 --> 00:16:32.150
I'm alive, after all.

00:16:32.520 --> 00:16:34.320
I have all sorts of thoughts.

00:16:34.860 --> 00:16:36.580
Then I shall change my question.

00:16:37.190 --> 00:16:40.130
What gave you the idea of
going to the Rose Mansion?

00:16:41.330 --> 00:16:42.160
Is it strange?

00:16:42.430 --> 00:16:46.130
I mean, do you find it fun going
to school when no one is there?

00:16:46.870 --> 00:16:50.560
So the school is just a container to you, isn't it?

00:16:51.740 --> 00:16:52.540
A container?

00:16:53.440 --> 00:16:54.930
A container for people.

00:16:55.940 --> 00:16:59.340
It must be that you are
interested in people right now.

00:17:00.380 --> 00:17:02.820
So you could care less about the container.

00:17:04.420 --> 00:17:08.150
You hardly seem uninterested
in people yourself.

00:17:09.290 --> 00:17:11.150
Yes, I am interested.

00:17:11.260 --> 00:17:12.160
In you.

00:17:14.660 --> 00:17:17.720
Because I am Rosa Gigantea's petite soeur?

00:17:19.230 --> 00:17:22.130
Or rather, in what is inside you.

00:17:28.510 --> 00:17:29.530
Safe Secure

00:17:30.080 --> 00:17:31.740
I feel so stupid.

00:17:32.650 --> 00:17:36.740
Walking around in this cold weather,
chasing after Rei-chan...

00:17:37.180 --> 00:17:41.050
If I'd stayed home, I wouldn't
have had to feel so empty.

00:17:45.230 --> 00:17:45.990
Rei-chan!

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:49.730
I-I wonder if they saw me.

00:18:06.480 --> 00:18:07.970
Um, Onee-sama?

00:18:09.080 --> 00:18:11.920
You often have lunch here, right?

00:18:12.820 --> 00:18:13.620
Yes...

00:18:14.120 --> 00:18:15.350
Then, it's settled.

00:18:15.560 --> 00:18:16.150
What?!

00:18:16.320 --> 00:18:17.920
O-Onee-sama!

00:18:22.160 --> 00:18:23.030
I see.

00:18:23.230 --> 00:18:26.460
So the system here is to make your
purchase before taking a seat.

00:18:26.570 --> 00:18:27.190
Yes.

00:18:27.870 --> 00:18:32.410
Yumi, if you see that I am at
a loss or if I make a mistake,

00:18:32.410 --> 00:18:34.030
please smooth things over right away.

00:18:34.740 --> 00:18:36.400
Why, of course.

00:18:37.210 --> 00:18:38.340
But is this okay?

00:18:38.480 --> 00:18:41.450
Her record of never setting foot
in a place like this for 17 years...

00:18:41.450 --> 00:18:43.050
Yumi, we are next!

00:18:43.050 --> 00:18:44.040
Y-Yes!

00:18:44.820 --> 00:18:46.550
Onee-sama, please remember.

00:18:47.220 --> 00:18:51.420
Two each of the hamburger and
oolong tea, and one medium fries.

00:18:52.030 --> 00:18:52.960
I know.

00:18:53.330 --> 00:18:56.130
No additional orders,
no matter what they suggest, right?

00:18:56.460 --> 00:18:57.020
Yes.

00:18:57.970 --> 00:18:59.020
Leave it to me.

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:04.100
Welcome and hello. Will you be dining in?

00:19:04.270 --> 00:19:04.830
Yes.

00:19:04.970 --> 00:19:06.740
What would you like to order?

00:19:06.840 --> 00:19:07.310
Two each of the hamburger and
oolong tea, and one medium fries.

00:19:07.310 --> 00:19:08.880
It feels weird, because...
Two each of the hamburger and
oolong tea, and one medium fries.

00:19:08.880 --> 00:19:10.440
...our positions are reversed from the usual,
Two each of the hamburger and
oolong tea, and one medium fries.

00:19:10.440 --> 00:19:10.540
but this is kind of fun somehow.
Two each of the hamburger and
oolong tea, and one medium fries.

00:19:10.540 --> 00:19:11.750
but this is kind of fun somehow.

00:19:11.750 --> 00:19:12.510
but this is kind of fun somehow.
Would you care to order an apple pie with that?

00:19:12.510 --> 00:19:13.210
Would you care to order an apple pie with that?

00:19:13.210 --> 00:19:14.080
Steering clear of nuggets and apple pies,
Would you care to order an apple pie with that?

00:19:14.080 --> 00:19:14.450
Steering clear of nuggets and apple pies,

00:19:14.450 --> 00:19:15.610
Steering clear of nuggets and apple pies,
No, thank you.

00:19:15.850 --> 00:19:15.980
she did a perfect job placing the order...

00:19:15.980 --> 00:19:18.120
she did a perfect job placing the order...
The total comes out to 756 yen.

00:19:18.120 --> 00:19:19.120
