00:19:21.050 --> 00:19:22.520
Thank you for waiting.

00:19:22.960 --> 00:19:24.050
Please enjoy.

00:19:24.530 --> 00:19:25.390
Thank you.

00:19:30.530 --> 00:19:31.760
O-Onee-sama!

00:19:32.400 --> 00:19:35.070
This restaurant has a system
called "self-serve"...

00:19:35.070 --> 00:19:38.900
...and the customers carry their own
purchases to their seats to eat.

00:19:40.040 --> 00:19:40.600
What?

00:19:40.970 --> 00:19:43.910
But you never told me anything about that.

00:19:44.280 --> 00:19:45.340
Pardon me.

00:19:45.610 --> 00:19:48.670
I thought you might have noticed by
seeing the people in front of us.

00:19:49.120 --> 00:19:51.020
You were telling me all sorts of things,

00:19:51.080 --> 00:19:54.020
so I had no time to observe
the other customers.

00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:56.050
I-I'm sorry.

00:19:56.790 --> 00:19:57.620
It will grow cold.

00:19:57.890 --> 00:19:58.980
Shall we eat?

00:19:59.160 --> 00:19:59.720
Yes.

00:20:15.510 --> 00:20:16.500
It can't be...
It can't be...

00:20:17.080 --> 00:20:17.670
What?
What?

00:20:19.050 --> 00:20:20.410
O-Onee-sama,

00:20:20.950 --> 00:20:25.250
fast food hamburgers don't
come with knives and forks.

00:20:28.290 --> 00:20:29.410
So it seems.

00:20:29.920 --> 00:20:31.120
How careless of me.

00:20:31.460 --> 00:20:33.390
I should have learned my
lesson from sandwiches.

00:20:33.660 --> 00:20:34.220
What?

00:20:34.430 --> 00:20:36.190
Then, at your home...

00:20:36.330 --> 00:20:37.520
Well, excuse me.

00:20:37.830 --> 00:20:40.820
At home, we even eat
sandwiches with knives and forks.

00:20:41.240 --> 00:20:42.070
I know!

00:20:42.470 --> 00:20:46.870
They may have knives and
forks meant for pancakes,

00:20:46.870 --> 00:20:47.810
so I will ask for some.

00:20:48.410 --> 00:20:49.430
It's fine, Yumi.

00:20:49.680 --> 00:20:50.340
But...

00:20:51.310 --> 00:20:53.250
There is no point if I do not eat it as is.

00:20:53.650 --> 00:20:54.640
I shall have it now.

00:21:02.290 --> 00:21:03.310
It's delicious.

00:21:04.320 --> 00:21:05.590
I'm so glad!

00:21:05.960 --> 00:21:07.760
You're so melodramatic, Yumi.

00:21:43.200 --> 00:21:45.490
Where will you be taking me next?

00:21:45.630 --> 00:21:47.500
Uh, um, well...

00:21:49.070 --> 00:21:49.660
Yumi?

00:21:50.100 --> 00:21:51.070
Um...

00:21:51.840 --> 00:21:55.430
What'll I do? My plan was to
decide during lunch, but...

00:22:00.450 --> 00:22:01.510
Onee-sama?!

00:22:02.050 --> 00:22:03.810
No! It can't be...

00:22:04.420 --> 00:22:07.390
Did she become disgusted
with our date and go home?!

00:22:09.060 --> 00:22:10.250
Onee-sama!

